add('')
add('Baseline is the existing `ab7dfba` 300-DPI ClearScan, glyph-sharing-off run. `baseline.py` re-verifies all five output SHA-256 hashes against #33r provenance; existing Adobe XI PDFs and registered renders are reused, never regenerated. The measurements cover all 32 corpus pages and 26 frozen #37 controls. `estimate.py` reproduces the current four-corner and absolute-luminance-distance foreground rule and compares dominant interior, supported bright mode, interior median and 128 px tile median. The latter four are offline measurements; only dominant interior was also instrumented through the real Rust pipeline. The switch is research-only and preserves/forces containment for any changed page with visible proposals; no unsafe vector PDF is emitted. The research code is on the branch named below; reproduction scripts are included.')
add('')
